From 5394908add388dc924e390c0475e19375fe418bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bradley Gleave <bradley@bradleytgpcoaching.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:41:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(trials): T5 regressions for the draft invoice fence
 (B-707-1)

The lenses' draft race (a renewal draft finalized and paid inside the
window, absent from or present on the first draft page), an unknown or
incomplete draft page, an unconfirmed finalize, a payment winning the
finalized draft, drafts counting toward TRIAL_CONFLICT_MAX_VOIDS, the
recheck of every list before the DELETE, and ownership loss across each
added await. Existing T5 fixtures answer the draft list with a complete
empty page and expect the recheck in their call order.
